OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGradually
OL,6,Fturning cloudier from the northwest
OL,7,Fthis evening with some light patchy
OL,8,Frain possible in the north, rain
OL,9,Fbecoming more widespread by the
OL,10,Fmorning. Rather breezy at times.
OL,11,FAnother warm night under cloud cover.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cooler day to come on Sunday
OL,14,Fwith a mix of bright spells and
OL,15,Fshowers, these may turn heavy at
OL,16,Ftimes. Often rather breezy, especially
OL,17,Fover hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
