OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry into the new week with lots of
OL,7,Fsunshine and some variable cloud.
OL,8,FTemperatures gradually increasing
OL,9,Fagain, day by day, with another hot
OL,10,Fspell to come.
